  "content": "<p><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/lcc22tx.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"1127\" height=\"325\"></p><h2>&nbsp;</h2><h2>想要为你的世界增添更多激动人心的Boss战吗？本模组的目标就是打造史诗级的终局Boss战。</h2><p style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;</p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:18px;color:#f00\">这是Barribob的Bosses of Mass Destruction模组从Fabric移植到Forge的非官方版本。点击<a style=\"color:#f00\" href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/bosses-of-mass-destruction\" rel=\"nofollow\">此处</a>访问原项目。</span></p><p><span style=\"font-size:14px\">目前，本模组包含四个Boss。</span></p><ul><li><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>夜之巫妖</strong>，生成于寒冷生物群系的稀有塔楼中。跟随灵魂之星寻找塔楼位置。</span></li><li><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>黑曜石柱</strong>，出现在末地岛屿的稀有结构内。</span></li><li><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>下界护手</strong>，生成于下界的稀有结构中。</span></li><li><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>虚空之花</strong>，出现在世界底部的稀有洞穴中。虚空百合会指明方向。</span></li><li><span style=\"font-size:14px\">可通过/summon指令在创造模式中召唤。</span></li></ul><p><span style=\"font-size:14px\">安装方法：<br><br></span></p><p><span style=\"font-size:14px\">像其他常规Forge模组一样安装，并需安装以下依赖项。</span></p><ul><li><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/cerbons-api-forge\" rel=\"nofollow\">CERBON's API (1.20.1+)</a></span></li><li><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/geckolib\" rel=\"nofollow\">Geckolib</a></span></li><li><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/cloth-config\" rel=\"nofollow\">Cloth Config API</a></span></li></ul><p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:24px\">支持</span></p><p><span style=\"font-size:14px\">请将所有Bug、问题和功能请求报告至<a href=\"https://github.com/CERBON-MODS/Bosses-of-Mass-Destruction-FORGE/issues\" rel=\"nofollow\">问题追踪器</a>，或使用我的<a href=\"https://discord.gg/2PvYZfjWDf\" rel=\"nofollow\">Discord服务器</a>在相应频道提交。请在评论区仅留下对模组的评论或简单问题。</span></p><p><span style=\"font-size:14px\">&nbsp;</span></p><p><span style=\"font-size:14px\">在报告Bug、问题或功能请求前，请先阅读<a href=\"https://github.com/CERBON-MODS/Bosses-of-Mass-Destruction-FORGE/blob/master/FAQ.md\" rel=\"nofollow\">常见问题解答</a>。</span></p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:24px\">其他项目</span>&nbsp;</p><p><span style=\"font-size:14px\">我还有其他模组您可能感兴趣：</span></p><p><span style=\"font-size:14px\">&nbsp;</span></p><p><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/better-totem-of-undying-forge\" rel=\"nofollow\">更好的不死图腾 [FORGE]</a></span></p><p><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/better-totem-of-undying-fabric\" rel=\"nofollow\">更好的不死图腾 [FABRIC]</a></span></p><p><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/sugared-concrete-powder\" rel=\"nofollow\">糖化混凝土粉末 [FORGE]</a></span><br><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/queen-bee\" rel=\"nofollow\">蜂后 [FORGE]</a></span></p><p><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/cerbons-better-beacons-forge\" rel=\"nofollow\"><span style=\"text-decoration:underline\"><strong>更好的信标 [FORGE]</strong></span></a></span></p><p><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/just-enough-beacons-reforged\" rel=\"nofollow\">Just Enough Beacons Reforged</a></span></p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:24px\">需要服务器吗？</span></p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:24px\"><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fbisecthosting.com%252fCerbon\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://www.bisecthosting.com/images/CF/CERBONs_Better_Totem_of_Undying/BH_CBTU_promo.webp\" alt=\"\" width=\"1100\" height=\"250\"></a></span></p>",
